        "sid": "COL 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gár ni slaa' masók kuungá' an tsahhá' adór aníng nir daawiimiit as kuungá', nee as múk yaamaá Laodikia, nee as kudá' hatlá' sleémeero awa aníng iga ari'iiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gár ni slaa' masók inooín kin gurkwa/as, nee kiwa haragaasi baraá sla'aari, as xu'utír baraá qeeru ngiwa slaya', lu/aaroó Mungú kuwa tsaahha hhe'eesi. Nee lu/aaroó Mungú an Kristo inósuú kilá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sagalooár Mungú sleémeero nee xu'utirós sleémeero i baraá Kristo i dirí'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tí án ngina dirhúngií oó' as kahhó' hee munduwa al/aáy ar axweesanoó tawo oo lama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma án tam kahha dirhunge baraá slaqwto, tam adoorihe aníng a dinkwa nee kuungá' ar baraá qeeru. Aníng a ló' wa qwalalaá/ asma aga tsaáhh adór slafingwhúng kur hhohhó', nee adór haratlintaaorhúng ir /uuruú koón baraá Kristoowo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' Kristo una ilaoté' tawa Aako. Nee ala daxta hooté' baraá slafingwhunge, tawa aldinku'uumisa' nee inós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dee/áruuhúng masók ku gawít baraawose, slafingwhúng gawaawós wa tlehhiitaak, kuungá' masók an kwa/aakwa/á' baraá haratlintaaorhunge ar adoodá' tundura intsaahhatimís, nee tawa hatsa' sluufaywo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti harmagahhe', hee munduwa naáxw ar axweesanaywós oo tawo oo gaa wásl oo al/ayma. Asma axweesanaydá' amór naa daáhh a amór unuú muu, a amór Kristoowooká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Mungú nee munguiimarós sleémeero i baraá Kristó wa hoot, gídaabá baraá slaqwtós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam kuungaádá' aga dinku'use' nee inós, slafíngw haáts ugwa sleeré'. Inós ku úr dír geeraharuuse sleémeerowo nee kudá' sleémeero aleesleemuú koomá' baraá qeeruuwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sleeme kuungá' nee inós tawa aldinku'uumisé' tunduna al/utlín, ala ar al/utlór slaqwtooká, ala aqo ar al/utlodár Kristó kilá', slaqwtahúng tidár tlakweema kawa hingesé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma qoomár tunduwa baatimiís, tunduna al foól dinkwa nee Kristo, tunduri waaslee/atís sleeme dinkwa nee inós, asma /uuruú Mungú kuwa haratlintié', kudá' Kristo ngwa waaslee/atis baraá múk aa qaátl wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' aáng a tu'u, as tlakweemaahúng, nee as tunduwa al/utliiká, asma kuungá' tawa múk xoordaá hatlá'. Ala hám Mungú kuungá' sleeme naa slafís dinkwa nee Kristo, qoomár tlakweemaarén sleémeero ngiwa gurtláy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee dugunoó iinaarén guna fiíts, kudá' geera atén ti iinuús tlehhema'aá yaariire. Guri hingeés, guri kikií' gawaá msalaába. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá msalaábaro Kristo baaluusér neetlaame /uuruuín guna hingeés, nee kudá' aleesleemuú koomá' aleesleemuuín guna hingeés. Nee inós inooín sleémeero ngiwa baál, gari geehhooatís adór i dirii'iya'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe kuungá' ma ya/aamara' as hee nuwa tawó sakwasleemuuti as muruú /ayma nee muruú wahaangw, laqaá as deelór uren, laqaá as deelór slahhaangw niwa ti'iít, laqaá as deelór Sabaáto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma mura' sleémeero oo adór kwí a geehhaantamoó tawo oo kudá' hardáh. Ala gár kilá' an Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukko i deer, oo ti kilooín niinaweemiís ar al/ayma, nee adoorí ngi sa qwalaala/iyá', slám i malaykér firiiriná'. Nee tin kilooín xirfayeemisiyá' as iigu'utuuín, gár tas daara/an ar kilá' i káhh, a inslaway'ín oo tlákw. Múk adór kwí munduwa al/aáy nee qeemuuhúng guri hayoh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín ta aldinku'uumisiiká nee Kristo, kuduú saga. Asma baraá geerahartá Kristowo slaqwa sleémeero kan /aymiis, nee diqiyaawós sleémeero, kin dinkwár i nigihhitis ar kane. Adoorihe slaqwa sleémeero /uuru gun sleér, iri uraareér adoodá' Mungú ngir slai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' aga alqatlé' dinkwa nee Kristo, tiri paratlé' nee aleesleemu sleémeero oo qeereemaá tlakw awa yaamuuká'. Asma milá mas ya/a/aandá' kuungá' tunduwa hara'ayiyin, adór múk yaamuuká', tawa kaahi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ma taatahhaar, ma tsaqaar, ma kwatiitaar.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruuwí sleémeero a muruú hhitiruút burku sagadiyuus. Hara'ayduudá' nee intsaahhatisadae amór muu ngi dahhiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bir ga/eér kwaáo a adór múk sageeloén. Asma inooín malayke ngin firiiriná', nee ti kilooín niinaweemiisiyá' ar al/aymár tawo. Slám slaqooín ngin slahh'eemisiyá'. Ala tí sleémeero a gadiyér tawo, asma bira fák, aqo ilatleerír tawo ar kángw slaqo ngin boo/eemisiyá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
